'''Spun''' is a [[transformation]] added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Afterbirth]]'', turning Isaac into a buff berserker after picking up 3 syringe items.

== Effects ==
* Drops a random [[pill]].
* +2 [[damage]].
* +0.15 [[speed]].
** {{dlc|nr}} Also affects maximum Speed. Maximum Speed may never exceed 2.0.

== Requirements ==
Pick up 3 [[item]]s from the following list ({{dlc|r}} with the [[Item Tags syringe|{{code|syringe}} tag]]).

=== Passive Collectibles ===
{{collectible table | Adrenaline, Euthanasia, Experimental Treatment, Growth Hormones, Roid Rage, Speed Ball, Synthoil, The Virus }}

