== Trivia ==
* [https://www.urbandictionary.com/define.php?term=Spun Spun] is a slang used to describe someone who is extremely high on methamphetamine.
* In [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mewgenics Mewgenics] (another game made by Edmund McMillen), an enemy called the [https://mewgenics.wiki.gg/wiki/Spun_Cat Spun Cat] takes the same appearence as the Spun transformation, even having "Spun" in it's name.

